# Workspace path layouts

The product trees live under `Cursor-Project/`:

- Phoenix repositories: `Cursor-Project/Phoenix/` (for example `Cursor-Project/Phoenix/phoenix-core`)
- EnergoTS: `Cursor-Project/EnergoTS/`
- Playwright tests: `Cursor-Project/EnergoTS/src/tests/` (`*.spec.ts`, `*.fixtures.ts`)

`Cursor-Project/` also holds setup, config, docs, and scripts. A copy at the repository root (`Phoenix/`, `EnergoTS/`) is only a fallback if the `Cursor-Project/` tree is missing. Scripts and rules accept both spellings. Rule 0.8 applies to both. Phoenix stays read-only. Database stored procedures and functions stay unchanged. EnergoTS writes stay limited to the EnergoTS test agent under `src/tests/` on the `cursor` branch.
